#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:214
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Liste de contrôle de migration"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:216
msgid "For a clean port to v4.5.6 the typical work is:"
msgstr ""
"Pour un portage propre vers v4.5.6, le travail typique est le suivant :"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:218
msgid ""
"Port ML code to :mod:`ml`: construct ``ml.Model(path)``, call ``predict()``,"
" read ``model.labels``, expect ``ndarray`` outputs, and move normalization "
"to :class:`ml.preprocessing.Normalization` and NMS to :mod:`ml.utils` "
"(:ref:`the ml package change <v4_5_6_ml>`)."
msgstr ""
"Portez le code ML vers :mod:`ml` : construisez ``ml.Model(path)``, appelez "
"``predict()``, lisez ``model.labels``, attendez-vous à des sorties "
"``ndarray``, et déplacez la normalisation vers "
":class:`ml.preprocessing.Normalization` et la NMS vers :mod:`ml.utils` "
"(:ref:`le changement du paquet ml <v4_5_6_ml>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:222
msgid ""
"Replace ``image.unpack()`` with ``image.to_ndarray()`` (:ref:`the unpack "
"removal <v4_5_6_unpack>`)."
msgstr ""
"Remplacez ``image.unpack()`` par ``image.to_ndarray()`` (:ref:`la "
"suppression de unpack <v4_5_6_unpack>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:224
msgid ""
"Update any ``Image()`` raw-array ``scale`` argument to a ``(min, max)`` "
"range (:ref:`the Image scale change <v4_5_6_imgscale>`)."
msgstr ""
"Mettez à jour tout argument ``scale`` de tableau brut de ``Image()`` vers "
"une plage ``(min, max)`` (:ref:`le changement de scale d'Image "
"<v4_5_6_imgscale>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:226
msgid ""
"If you use Haar cascades on an affected board, rebuild with the feature "
"enabled (:ref:`the Haar cascade change <v4_5_6_haar>`)."
msgstr ""
"Si vous utilisez des cascades de Haar sur une carte concernée, reconstruisez"
" avec la fonctionnalité activée (:ref:`le changement des cascades de Haar "
"<v4_5_6_haar>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:228
msgid ""
"Re-validate models that depended on ``SCALE_S128_127`` (:ref:`the scaling "
"change <v4_5_6_behavior>`)."
msgstr ""
"Revalidez les modèles qui dépendaient de ``SCALE_S128_127`` (:ref:`le "
"changement de mise à l'échelle <v4_5_6_behavior>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.5.6.rst:230
msgid "Move dual-core code to Open-AMP (:ref:`the CM4 change <v4_5_6_cm4>`)."
msgstr ""
"Migrez le code bicœur vers Open-AMP (:ref:`le changement CM4 <v4_5_6_cm4>`)."
